@baseUrl = https://localhost:5081
@accessToken = replace-with-authorized-Entra-access-token

### Read status without registering a trial
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subscription
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Explicitly start the tenant's single 30-day trial (idempotent)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subscription/trial
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Anonymous requests must return 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subscription
